          "quote": "The results showed that the compressive yield strength of this Nb–Al–V alloy improved significantly with Hf and/or TiC addition at room and elevated temperatures. The influence of Hf and TiC addition on the strength could be described via solid solution strengthening and composite strengthening, respectively. In the NbAlVHf alloy, Hf is completely dissolved into the matrix and therefore contributes solid solution strengthening.",
